e": "com.medvr.urine-20251014-164050-1.00_00_25_23.Still007.png", "id": "777351328802760", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_777351332136093_865671952753012563_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5KKI-zUavgAQ7kNvwF3pqFJ&_nc_oc=AdnVQZCJfCDTdSBhd1yMCESZVorIQj7N9ZHP1zHOD62QTOo2VK7VbZnSURMyhWGiaQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsQFm0UwVUJ4YqBcrPyX59jeRjnzeI4akyJG1bf8g6ONg&oe=69A5A090"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.urine-20251014-164050-1.00_00_05_16.Still002.png", "id": "1339142241074878", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819417_1339142244408211_3880815082763147902_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fMpTAcTag60Q7kNvwEuu5Rv&_nc_oc=AdnJwE1ZPkXgLKD31Hzb8_gB98rEnJUnp-b8g3j3oJDJZqFsMnnjvIMbG0rHYkbH7l4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs7fuM9iRAyCUlPVe6Xg1cSUlBO5jSMPtaPbnuZN3R1qA&oe=69A580DB"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.urine-20251014-164050-1.00_00_23_00.Still006.png", "id": "1798700101012923", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824534_1798700104346256_5824087066573565822_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UDi2BxT21EIQ7kNvwGoobg7&_nc_oc=Admf12wh9KtN4z70g36kwlnIEht0g3f2qea9o-7UdaJ17dLnC0Rt5RqqgfS0N6lrNyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftdyyGqA6dS_LtqBVxJDqDmR8_Os2y8fZkKtTUjQsKmzA&oe=69A57190"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Urine Midstream Collection", "keywords": ["Medvr", "NBME", "VR", "Urine", "Midstream"], "long_description": "Urine Midstream Collection is an immersive VR training simulation designed to teach and assess the correct technique for collecting a midstream urine sample. This interactive experience guides learners through each step of the procedure\u2014from preparation and patient guidance to sample handling and labeling\u2014within a realistic clinical setting.\n\nDeveloped for healthcare students and professionals, this si